        "topic": "Logarithms",
        "question": "Express $2^5 = 32$ in its logarithmic form:",
        "options": {
          "A": "$\\log_2 32 = 5$",
          "B": "$\\log_5 32 = 2$",
          "C": "$\\log_{32} 2 = 5$",
          "D": "$\\log_2 5 = 32$"
        },
        "correctAnswer": "A",
        "explanation": "If $a^x = y$, then logarithmic form is $\\log_a y = x$. Thus, $2^5 = 32 \\implies \\log_2 32 = 5$.",
        "difficulty": "medium",
