        "topic": "Factorization and Algebraic Manipulation",
        "question": "Factorize the difference of cubes expression $8x^3 - 1$:",
        "options": {
          "A": "$(2x - 1)(4x^2 + 2x + 1)$",
          "B": "$(2x - 1)(4x^2 - 2x + 1)$",
          "C": "$(2x + 1)(4x^2 - 2x + 1)$",
          "D": "$(2x - 1)^3$"
        },
        "correctAnswer": "A",
        "explanation": "Using $a^3 - b^3 = (a - b)(a^2 + ab + b^2)$ where $a = 2x, b = 1$: $(2x - 1)(4x^2 + 2x + 1)$.",
